# Shell scripts must stay LF on every checkout: bash cannot run a CRLF script, and on a Windows
# clone with core.autocrlf=true the hooks in .claude/hooks/ and the scripts/ tooling otherwise
# arrive as CRLF and fail with "$'\r': command not found" (roadmap item 19e).
*.sh text eol=lf
# Text the generators and checkers compare byte-for-byte stays LF too (work/docs-reconcile R-8).
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
